{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfMQ1i5RW7d9PxTb2CHsp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TFF7wZiG5GnVzMySCMqquP","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"«WORKING_AREA»/spec.md","content":"# Spec: Dark-Mode Toggle\n\nStatus: ready-for-agent\n\n## Summary\nAdd a theme control to the Settings page so users can choose light or dark mode. Each user's choice is saved in their profile.\n\n## Requirements\n- Settings page shows a theme control with three options: **Light**, **Dark**, **System**.\n- Default is **System**, which follows the OS `prefers-color-scheme` setting.\n- The choice is saved to the user's profile, e.g. `themePreference: \"light\" | \"dark\" | \"system\"`.\n- The saved choice applies on every device and session after login.\n- A change takes effect right away, with no page reload.\n- In System mode, the app updates live when the OS theme changes.\n- Avoid a flash of the wrong theme on load: apply the theme before first paint.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Custom color themes beyond light and dark.\n- Per-page theme overrides.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- A new user sees the theme that matches their OS.\n- Choosing Dark still applies after logout, login, and switching devices.\n- Switching back to System follows the OS again.\n- The control is keyboard-accessible and labeled for screen readers.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3797,"cache_read_input_tokens":11472,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3797},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"messages_changed","cache_missed_input_tokens":3398}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb","uuid":"17e55d0d-fbb9-4e28-9ad6-fb22df7514ee","timestamp":"2026-09-24T01:29:10.556Z","request_id":"req_011CfMQ1hf7yG7KdSE5oSGcU","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01TFF7wZiG5GnVzMySCMqquP":{"file_path":"«WORKING_AREA»/spec.md","content":"# Spec: Dark-Mode Toggle\n\nStatus: ready-for-agent\n\n## Summary\nAdd a theme control to the Settings page so users can choose light or dark mode. Each user's choice is saved in their profile.\n\n## Requirements\n- Settings page shows a theme control with three options: **Light**, **Dark**, **System**.\n- Default is **System**, which follows the OS `prefers-color-scheme` setting.\n- The choice is saved to the user's profile, e.g. `themePreference: \"light\" | \"dark\" | \"system\"`.\n- The saved choice applies on every device and session after login.\n- A change takes effect right away, with no page reload.\n- In System mode, the app updates live when the OS theme changes.\n- Avoid a flash of the wrong theme on load: apply the theme before first paint.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Custom color themes beyond light and dark.\n- Per-page theme overrides.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- A new user sees the theme that matches their OS.\n- Choosing Dark still applies after logout, login, and switching devices.\n- Switching back to System follows the OS again.\n- The control is keyboard-accessible and labeled for screen readers.\n"}}}
